T["5x |cffFFFFFFCommon|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Card|r\n5x |cff1eff00Uncommon|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Card|r\n|cff0070ddRare|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Card|r\n|cffa335eeEpic|r = |cffFFFFFF5 Cards|r\n|cffff8000Legendary|r = |cffFFFFFF25 Cards|r"]="5x |cffFFFFFFComum|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Cartão|r\n5x |cff1eff00Incomum|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Cartão|r\n|cff0070ddRaro|r = |cffFFFFFF1 Cartão|r\n|cffa335eeÉpico|r = |cffFFFFFF5 Cartões|r\n|cffff8000Lendário|r = |cffFFFFFF25 Cartões|r"
